  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "PostTrainBench-Trajectories",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tPostTrainBench Agent Traces\n\t\n\nAgent traces from PostTrainBench (GitHub), a benchmark that measures CLI agents' ability to post-train base LLMs.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTask\n\t\n\nEach agent is given:\n\nA pre-trained base LLM to fine-tune\nAn evaluation script for a specific benchmark\n10 hours on an NVIDIA H100 80GB GPU\n\nThe agent must autonomously improve the model's performance on the target benchmark using any post-training strategy it chooses (SFT, LoRA, RLHF, prompt engineering for data\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/aisa-group/PostTrainBench-Trajectories.",
